1
00:00:03,300 --> 00:00:08,447
Open Interaction Center, Management, Queue groups, and click Add queue group.

2
00:00:08,447 --> 00:00:11,238
Give it a Name, here Service, and save.

3
00:00:11,238 --> 00:00:12,850
Groups are optional.

4
00:00:20,742 --> 00:00:23,573
Now open Queues and click Add Queue.

5
00:00:23,573 --> 00:00:29,912
On the General card, type a Name, such as Support, and a Description for administrators.

6
00:00:36,208 --> 00:00:37,841
Pick the Queue group.

7
00:00:37,841 --> 00:00:39,293
Enabled is ticked:

8
00:00:39,293 --> 00:00:42,378
a disabled queue receives no new assignments.

